# Optional configuration for the normal app. The offline demo overrides database URLs.
# DATABASE_URL is read from .env by app.db. Export the other variables in the shell
# or configure them in your hosting provider; they are not auto-loaded by all modules.
DATABASE_URL=
# Generate privately: python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(48))"
# Set STUDYMATE_SESSION_SECRET in the hosting environment, not in Git.
# Set STUDYMATE_SECURE_COOKIES=1 only behind public HTTPS.
# Set STUDYMATE_OFFLINE=1 to disable both map lookups and implicit model calls.
# Google calendar OAuth settings are retired from the normal app.
